  "title": "Rendered Horizons (A Distant Horizons Modpack)",
  "description": "[1.21.5 UPDATED] Distant Horizons, with shaders and peak performance that will truly beautify Minecraft.",
  "body": "<center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e1dbc4c6ebcd0ebba91da5f25c48758d95572d09.png\" alt=\"RENDERED HORIZONS\"></center>\n<center><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/LATEST VERSION-1.21.5-blue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"VERSION\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/LAST UPDATED-6 MAY 2025-006A4E?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"UPDATED\"></center>\n\n## <center>Description</center>\n**Rendered Horizons** is a _lightweight_ modpack featuring Distant Horizons and Iris Shaders, allowing you to see _extremely f***ing far_. 👀\n\nIt includes compatible shaderpacks & eye-catching vanilla-like world generation by Tectonic. It's designed for seamless use on any server, it just works out of the box! \n\n## <center>Performance and FPS</center>\n<details>\n  <summary>Settings and Specs</summary>\n  <strong>Specs</strong><br><br>\n  Graphics Card: RTX 3060ti<br>\n  Processor: Ryzen 7 5700g<br>\n  OS: Windows 11<br>\n  RAM: 16gigs DDR4<br>\n  RAM allocated: 10000MB<br><br>\n  <strong>Distant Horizons Settings</strong><br><br>\n  Quality: Medium<br>\n  CPU Load: Low Impact<br>\n  LOD Render Distance: 128<br><br>\n  <strong>Minecraft Settings</strong><br><br>\n  Resolution: 1440 x 1080<br>\n  Shadow Distance: 12<br>\n  Render Distance: 12<br>\n  Simulation Distance: 5<br>\n  Shader: Complementary Re-imagined<br>\n  FPS: Average - 142<br>\n</details>\n\n## <center>Comparison</center>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Features</th>\n      <th>Rendered Horizons</th>\n      <th>Distantly Optimized</th>\n      <th>New Horizons</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Utility</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n      <td>No</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Optimization</td>\n      <td>Yes, with custom settings and better performance</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n      <td>No</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Shaders</td>\n      <td>Yes, with custom settings for max performance and appearance</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Terrain / WorldGen</td>\n      <td>Yes, with Tectonic and several terrain improvement mods</td>\n      <td>Yes, but only with tectonic</td>\n      <td>Yes, doesn't feel vanilla</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Updates</td>\n      <td>Yes, frequent updates including shaders and utilities</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table><Br>\n\n### Download the modpack and experience it for your own! You don't need a powerful PC!\n<img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\">",
